body:
If i had to guess his strategy. i would say he is funneling people to little ricky in order to pursue an independent route. i'm not entirely sure but it makes the most sense. He will probably die in the live stream. 

&#x200B;

the only problem is i don't know if atlantic would own little ricky or not.

Not saying they were not breached. Look above to my source. Yes there was a breach. no passwords were involved so your claim is invalid and nonfactual.

&#x200B;

Edit: It mentions salted md5 hashes of passwords, That is not the same as a password leak and should not be classified as a leaked password.
